 Imperial Japanese Navy, who was flying on an inspection tour of forward bases in the Solomon Islands. The mission, codenamed \"Operation Vengeance,\" was approved by President Roosevelt himself. Sixteen P-38s flew over 400 miles at treetop level to avoid radar detection and intercepted two Japanese bombers and their fighter escort over the jungles of Bougainville. X’s aircraft was hit and crashed into the jungle, killing him. X was the architect of Y and reportedly said after Y: \"I fear all we have done is to awaken a sleeping giant and fill him with a terrible resolve.\" ID X (8 points) and Y (7 points). ‎<attached: 00120686-PHOTO-2026-04-18-08-31-32.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:31:47Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Yamamoto", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:31:50Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Y pewarl", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:31:51Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Pearl Harbor", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:31:53Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Har our", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:31:53Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Pearl harbour", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:31:56Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Attack", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:32:18Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: X=Admiral Isoroku Yamamoto, Y=Attack on Pearl Harbor", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:32:50Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri"